<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Coca-Cola buy of UK bottler - source.</title>
<headline>EU clears Coca-Cola buy of UK bottler - source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Wednesday cleared a plan by Coca-Cola Enterprises Inc to take full control of British bottler Coca-Cola &amp; Schweppes Beverages Ltd (CCSB), a European Union source said.</p>
<p>Coca-Cola Enterprises, the world's largest Coke bottler, is 45 percent owned by Coca-Cola Co. It is acquiring control of CCSB from Cadbury Schweppes through its purchase of Amalgamated Beverages Great Britain Ltd.</p>
<p>No details were immediately available of the clearance, but a formal statement was expected later.</p>
</text>
